sequenceDiagram
    title SD-04 - Grade Entry
    participant P0 as Teacher
    participant P1 as Grade Entry UI
    participant P2 as Grade Service
    participant P3 as Grade Repository
    participant P4 as Database
    P0->>P1: Select section, term, component, enter scores
    P1->>P2: saveGrades(batch)
    P2->>P2: Authorize teaching assignment
    P2->>P3: loadContextAndStudents()
    P3->>P4: Read section, term, assignments, finalization
    P4->>P3: Academic context
    P2->>P2: Validate section history, score bounds, not finalized
    P2->>P3: beginTransaction(), upsertGrades()
    P3->>P4: INSERT/UPDATE grades, COMMIT
    P4->>P3: Saved / rollback
    P3->>P2: Result
    Note over P2: alt: success or rejected
    P1->>P0: Show saved scores / errors
